                    <h2>8. OCI Application Checklist</h2>
                    <p>Before submission, consider the following checklist.</p>

                    <div class="checklist-group">
                        <h3>Eligibility</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>The relevant eligibility category has been identified.</li>
                            <li>Applicable exclusions have been considered.</li>
                            <li>The claimed family relationship is documented where required.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="checklist-group">
                        <h3>Identity and citizenship</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Current passport details have been checked.</li>
                            <li>Relevant citizenship or naturalisation documents have been identified.</li>
                            <li>Previous Indian passport documentation has been reviewed, where applicable.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="checklist-group">
                        <h3>Family relationship</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Birth certificates or other relevant relationship documents have been collected.</li>
                            <li>Name differences have been identified.</li>
                            <li>Required marriage, divorce or custody documents have been considered.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="checklist-group">
                        <h3>Address and supporting documents</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>Accepted address evidence has been identified.</li>
                            <li>Required translations and authentication have been checked.</li>
                            <li>The documents correspond to the selected application category.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="checklist-group">
                        <h3>Online submission</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>The current official portal instructions have been checked.</li>
                            <li>The application details match the source documents.</li>
                            <li>Photograph and signature requirements have been checked.</li>
                            <li>The current fee has been confirmed.</li>
                            <li>The application reference and payment confirmation have been retained.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <div class="checklist-group">
                        <h3>Verification and follow-up</h3>
                        <ul>
                            <li>The correct Mission, Post or FRRO has been identified.</li>
                            <li>Original-document verification instructions have been reviewed.</li>
                            <li>The applicant knows how to monitor the application and respond to requests.</li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>

                    <p>This is a general checklist. It does not replace the current official checklist for the applicant's specific circumstances.</p>
                </section>

